      197.85,
      203.33,
      365.84,
      214.67
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE UNV FOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      228.53,
      401.92,
      290.27
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an Association called and known as the \u201cUnVFoundation\u201d has heretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for thepurpose of effectually carrying out and transacting all objectsand matters connected with the said Foundation, accordingto the rules agreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.13,
      401.9,
      365.87
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for public advantage to grantsuch application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      379.73,
      401.9,
      403.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      417.53,
      401.88,
      441.47
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the UnV Foundation(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      455.33,
      401.9,
      580.07
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of the \u201cUnVFoundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cFoundation\u201d)and shall hereafter be admitted as members of the Corporationhereby constituted, shall be a body corporate, (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession,under the name and style of \u201cUnV Foundation\u201d and by thatname may sue and be sued in all courts, with full power andauthority to have and use a common seal and alter the same atits pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      593.93,
      401.87,
      617.87
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      631.73,
      343.33,
      643.07
    ],
    "text": "(a) to improve the education of children;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      657.77,
      349.31,
      669.11
    ],
    "text": "(b) to promote peace among communities;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      419.35,
      443.86,
      428.42
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
