    "bbox": [
      170.71,
      203.81,
      384.46,
      215.15
    ],
    "text": "(c) to participate in the development of the country;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      230.45,
      397.18,
      254.99
    ],
    "text": "(d) to advise and assist all communities in Sri Lanka tolive in peace and harmony;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      170.71,
      270.29,
      397.19,
      308.27
    ],
    "text": "(e) organizing and conducting a separate unit for theSocial Welfare, Economic Development andEducational Improvement of Ladies;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.15,
      323.45,
      397.2,
      388.07
    ],
    "text": "(f) to assist the development of educational, religious,cultural, aesthetic and sports facilities without anyreference to race, religion or cast and to provide withadequate funds and implemention of food schemesfor the state and private orphanages;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      403.25,
      397.19,
      427.91
    ],
    "text": "(g) to stop proliferation of drug menace and torehabilitate drug addicts;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      443.21,
      397.17,
      467.87
    ],
    "text": "(h) fishermen and farmers to be provided with the requiredequipment to develop the industry;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.15,
      483.05,
      397.16,
      507.71
    ],
    "text": "(i) youth to be provided financial assistance for self-employment;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.15,
      523.01,
      397.18,
      547.67
    ],
    "text": "(j) to provide for securing and maintenance of disciplineand cultural ethics;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      170.71,
      562.85,
      397.17,
      587.51
    ],
    "text": "(k) to liaise and co-ordinate with other local or foreigninstitutions when have similar objects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      601.73,
      397.2,
      671.03
    ],
    "text": "4. (1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to theother provisions of this Act and the rules in force for the timebeing of the Corporation, be administered by a Board ofDirectors consisting of a Chairman, Deputy Chairman,Secretary, Treasurer and another eleven members elected inaccordance with such rules.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      603.91,
      448.88,
      641.78
    ],
    "text": "Managementof the affairsof theCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
