      203.09,
      401.87,
      251.39
    ],
    "text": "(2) The founder member shall be Chairman of the Boardof Directors for life and thereafter, the family members of theperson who was holding office as the Chairman shall becomethe next Chairman of the Board of Directors.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.65,
      401.9,
      312.83
    ],
    "text": "(3) The first Board of the Corporation shall consist of themembers of the Board of Administration of the Foundationholding office on the day immediately preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      326.09,
      401.93,
      460.43
    ],
    "text": "5.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts, matters and thingswhatsoever, as are necessary or desirable for the promotionor furtherance of the objects of the Corporation or any oneof them, including the power to acquire and hold propertymovable, to open, operate and close bank accounts, to borrowor raise money with or without security, to erect any buildingor structure on any land held by the Corporation and toengage, employ and dismiss officers and servants requiredfor the carrying out of the objects of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      473.69,
      401.93,
      546.59
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation from time totime, at any general meeting of the members and by a majorityof not less than two-thirds of the members present and voting,to make rules, not inconsistence with the provisions of thisAct, or any other written law, for all or any of the followingmatters:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      559.85,
      401.86,
      595.79
    ],
    "text": "(a)classification of membership, admission,withdrawal, expulsion or resignation of membersand membership fees payable;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      609.05,
      401.87,
      670.07
    ],
    "text": "(b)procedure to be observed for the summoning andholding of meetings of the Corporation and of theBoard of Directors, the quorum for such meetingand the exercise and performance of their powersand duties;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
